// Layer_Feature_Service — Feature Service Layer (layer 4 of 9)
// Manual render: https://app.eraser.io > Diagram-as-code (cloud architecture).
//   Create a NEW canvas named "Layer_Feature_Service".
// Export the PNG to materials/reports/figures/Layer_Feature_Service.png
// Reference: subsec:lapisan-feature (Section IV.3, sec:arsitektur-terintegrasi); tool
//   detail for the layer in row 4 of tab:layanan_industri. Included as fig:layer-feature.
// Focus: Feast as the feature store with ClickHouse as the offline source,
//   Valkey as the materialized online store, Qdrant as the vector index,
//   file registry on MinIO; stream features from Flink land directly on
//   Valkey and Qdrant. The dual-store subsystem is detailed in sec:feature-store-dual.
// Icons: product logos from docs.eraser.io/docs/icons (checked 2026-07-11): minio,
//   clickhouse, qdrant; Valkey uses a generic icon (not the Redis logo, different fork brand).
// Rendering MUST be horizontal (direction right), at most two rows of nodes per group,
//   without \rotatebox in LaTeX.
// Layer basis: the group label carries its source category (najafabadi2024analysis),
//   namely feature store within storage and versioning.
// Implementation check: model-lifecycle/feast, storage/valkey, storage/qdrant,
//   storage/clickhouse, storage/minio; stream features Flink -> Valkey/Qdrant.

direction right

// Feature sources (boundary)
ClickHouse [icon: clickhouse, color: green, label: "ClickHouse (offline source)"]
Flink [icon: flink, color: orange, label: "Apache Flink (stream features)"]

// Feature Service Layer
Feature Service Layer [icon: package, color: green, label: "Feature Service Layer (feature store, storage and versioning)"] {
  Feast [icon: package, label: "Feast (feature store)"]
  Valkey [icon: zap, label: "Valkey (online store)"]
  Qdrant [icon: qdrant, label: "Qdrant (vector index)"]
}

// Registry and consumers (boundary)
MinIO [icon: minio, color: green, label: "MinIO (Feast file registry)"]
Model Lifecycle Layer [icon: refresh-cw, color: purple, label: "Model Lifecycle Layer (training and inference)"]

// Feature flow
ClickHouse > Feast: offline source
Feast > Valkey: online materialization
Feast > MinIO: file registry
Flink > Valkey: stream features
Flink > Qdrant: stream embeddings
Feast > Model Lifecycle Layer: training features
Valkey > Model Lifecycle Layer: online features
Qdrant > Model Lifecycle Layer: vector features
